(((where(Image ICONTAINS "\\Windows\\") AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\..\\Windows\\") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\..\\System32\\") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\..\\..\\"))) OR (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS ".exe\\..\\"))) AND NOT (((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\Citrix\\Virtual Smart Card\\Citrix.Authentication.VirtualSmartcard.Launcher.exe\\..\\")) OR (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "\\Google\\Drive\\googledrivesync.exe\\..\\")))))
